# SG4 - Understanding Classes and Objects
## Class Name: Sports player 
## Class Description: This provides the user with different inputs on a sport.
## Properties
| Property       | Data Type|             Description                        |
|Sport           | string   |The sport the player is playing                 |
|Nature of sport | string   |Their Sports’ nature                            |
|Special moves   |     int  | determines how many tricks they can use        |
|Vacancy         |  boolean | indicates if a player is available for matches |
## Methods
| Method                        | Description                                              |
|Swing()                        |makes the player fight back                               |
|blast()                        |smash, shoot, or spike                                    |
|Multiplayer aim(parameter: int)|determines how many players are working on the same attack|
