## Design Explanation
### Why did you choose this class? So that players can have an organized map of their sport
### Which property is the most important? Why? Sport, because the input relies on the sport they're playing 
### Which method is the most useful? Why? Multiplayer, because it gives the team a more powerful strike back against their opponent.
  
